sequenceDiagram
    participant I as ManagementContext
    participant D as DLX API
    participant E as External DLX

    I->>D: POST /admin_auth<br/>{ username, password, scope: "dlx.import" }
    D-->>I: JWT (scope: dlx.import)

    I->>D: POST /import<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT<br/>{ link, token, tfaAnswer }

    D->>E: GET /token/{value}<br/>from external link
    E-->>D: TFA Questions

    D->>E: POST /tokentfa/{value}<br/>TFA Answers
    E-->>D: JWT

    D->>E: GET /downloadall<br/>with external JWT
    E-->>D: DICOM Data

    alt Synchronous (fast)
        D-->>I: 200 - Import completed
    else Asynchronous (slow)
        D-->>I: 202 - Import started<br/>{ statusUrl }
    end
